{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式音ゲー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブで忙しくなってから\n全然やってなかったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんが昨日\n新メンバーで追加されたからまた始めた`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、\nピンクリボンブラウスver.の生駒ちゃん\n出たんだけど\nもっと強いのが欲しくて今頑張ってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクリボンブラウスver.は\nいつもレッスンの素材に使っちゃうからなー(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、\n久々に音ゲーやったら\n公演曲とか追加されてて\nテンション上がった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/19/2912332/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またはまりそう(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう\n無料アプリゲーマーのお話でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/19/2912332/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レモン味だよ～\nソフトクリームなのにすっきりしてて\n夏にぴったり！\n美味しかった＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/19/2912332/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドルに来ていただいた時も言ったけど\n『JUMP』のリリイベとか行ってます(・∀・)\nでもそれから行けてないから\n1年と半年くらい前になっちゃうけど＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/19/2912332/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家着いたのが遅くて\n見れたのFNSの最後のところだけだった(´・_・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は撮影のあとマッサージ行って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は1日撮影してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/19/2912332/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"濃い一日が送れて嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は空き時間多いけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空き時間は\nコメント読むかkoboか睡眠か音ゲー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと\nブログ書いてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも充実。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/19/2912332/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイプラさん一周年おめでとうございます`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんお世話になってるアイプラさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/19/2912332/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【祝 アイドルプラネット1周年記念】お祝い動画コメント\nhttp://idol-planet.com/%e6%9c%aa%e5%88%86%e9%a1%9e/201408/12-1st-anniversary"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップされました(*^^*)\n良かったら見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}